# The two copies for floats behind the front of a loop stand where the loop's own text multiplies or divides an element of the holder (a-loop-over-what-nobody-knows-has-a-copy-for-each-kind-of-floats.ir). A loop that adds up, compares, copies or looks up what it reads
# keeps the four members: floats share the copy of the other views and are read rightly, by the kind of the cell.
